#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1493
msgid "Bubble Plots"
msgstr "Bubbeldiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1497
msgid ""
"The data values from three series of equal length are plotted on the "
"Cartesian (X-Y) plane, the value from the first series determining the "
"position of the plotted symbol center along the X axis, the value from the "
"second series determining the position of the plotted symbol center along "
"the Y axis, and the value of the third series determining the radius of the "
"circle plotted. Each triplet of series can be plotted with different symbols"
" but the data values of any series can be shared."
msgstr ""
"Värden från tre lika långa dataserier ritas ut i det kartesiska "
"(X-Y-)planet. Värdet i den första serien bestämmer symbolens mittpunkt längs"
" X-axeln, värdet i den andra bestämmer mittpunkten längs Y-axeln och värdet "
"i den tredje bestämmer den ritade cirkelns radie. Varje grupp om tre serier "
"kan ritas med olika symboler, men dataserierna kan dela värden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1510
msgid "An example of a bubble plot"
msgstr "Exempel på ett bubbeldiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1518
msgid ""
"A screenshot of a worksheet with two series of data, each with three lists, "
"and of the resulting bubble plot."
msgstr ""
"En skärmbild av ett kalkylblad med två dataserier som vardera innehåller tre"
" listor, samt det resulterande bubbeldiagrammet."
